--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 76329f96a0bd36043946dd720240c25c, type: 3}
  m_Name: Akihito v Aegis hub world
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  data:
    convoName: Akihito v Aegis hub world
    speakers:
    - Akihito
    - Aegis
    lines:
    - character: King Aegis
      expression: 
      line: 'I may not be very proficient with the blade, but I am curious how one
        becomes such a master like yourself. '
      audio: {fileID: 0}
    - character: Akihito
      expression: 
      line: 'It requires years of training, both the mind and body.  '
      audio: {fileID: 0}
    - character: King Aegis
      expression: 
      line: 'That must take great resolve. '
      audio: {fileID: 0}
    - character: Akihito
      expression: 
      line: "Yes, and it\u2019s exhausting. I imagine you would know how hard it
        is to strengthen one\u2019s emotion and resolve to better oneself, being
        an emperor as you are. "
      audio: {fileID: 0}
    - character: King Aegis
      expression: 
      line: "I do. My royal responsibilities, the duties to my people, increased
        tenfold after my parents passed. There was much to learn so quickly. I\u2019ve
        always wondered if I made the right choices... "
      audio: {fileID: 0}
    - character: Akihito
      expression: 
      line: 'You are a ruler; being decisive comes with the title, does it not? '
      audio: {fileID: 0}
    - character: King Aegis
      expression: 
      line: 'It does, but that was my problem. '
      audio: {fileID: 0}
    - character: Akihito
      expression: 
      line: "\u2026 "
      audio: {fileID: 0}
    - character: Akihito
      expression: 
      line: "In order to be a samurai, I had to learn to trust myself. Perhaps the
        decisions I make may not always be the most correct ones, but they are my
        decisions nonetheless. I have to live, reaping what I sow, and I cannot do
        that if I\u2019m constantly second guessing myself.  "
      audio: {fileID: 0}
    - character: King Aegis
      expression: 
      line: "Interesting\u2026 I thank you, Akihito, for sharing your experiences.
        You would have made an amazing knight. "
      audio: {fileID: 0}
    - character: Akihito
      expression: 
      line: You have strength within you, King Aegis. I can sense that. It just needs
        direction.
      audio: {fileID: 0}
